:: Michael Hang Out Go To Park [nobr]

/* Intro */
You ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> if he wants to go to the park and the devious boy smirks. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure! Does little <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$MichaelNickname</span> want me to push him on the swings or help him down the slide? Don’t worry little guy!”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> teases in a high-pitched voice before putting you in a headlock and giving you a noogie.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Just make sure you go potty first. Wouldn’t want the height of the slide to make you piss yourself!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> continues to tease as you break free and run a bit forward.<br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Michael",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
			Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Tired",
            Blush: 1,
		},
