		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "Tease him back<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> that he’s the one who should run to the potty, <span style="color:Pink">considering his fly’s been down this whole time! <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> glances down quickly in embarrassment, only to see you’re just messing with him.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, is that how it is? Well then-!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> begins to chase you with a devious smile as you run ahead towards the park. <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Michael Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Embrace your childhood<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You cross your arms and smile, telling <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> that, unlike him, you’re not embarrassed to embrace your childhood. <span style="color:LightGreen">You only get one, so you’re going to enjoy it as long as you can.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Michael</span> rolls his eyes at this with a smirk, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Whatever. If you want to be a baby, we can buy you some diapers to wear. I prefer the mature life, but I guess I can hang out and watch you make a fool of yourself, at least. Just don’t expect me to play hide and seek or anything.”</span> He laughs as you both reach the park.<br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Michael Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>